    "description": {
      "value": "These bracers are made from plates of durable mithral and gleam like the summer sun.\n\n- **Activate:** Reaction\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n- **Trigger:** A ranged weapon attack hits you but doesn't critically hit\n- **Requirements:** You are aware of the attack and not flat-footed\n\nThe bracers send the missile off-course. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack. If this would cause the attack to be a failure, the attack misses you.\n\nYou can activate the bracers once every 10 minutes."
